                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "Data are from [turner1986organic]. The research is also reported in [byrne1989above] and [bradstock1981biomass]. These data are from a chronosequence of approximately even-aged stands of native forests of _E grandis_ and include the oldest stands simulated so far by the APSIM Eucalyptus model. They are the only native forest data in this set of simulations; all other simulations are of plantations.\r\n\n\n",
