              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "These data are for Forestry SA growth plots, and were provided Jim O'Hehir, University of South Australia. As they are in a region with a water table containing nitrate that can be reached by roots, these components were added to the simulation. However, nitrate was not described as a concentration in groundwater, but instead nitrate was applied as nitrate fertiliser at 2.5 m depth or greater four times per year. Thinned and unthinned stands are included.\r\n\r\n\n",
